diff --git a/docs/src/man/man1/halcompile.1.adoc b/docs/src/man/man1/halcompile.1.adoc
index c06cd1b868..f5f5bc1116 100644
--- a/docs/src/man/man1/halcompile.1.adoc
+++ b/docs/src/man/man1/halcompile.1.adoc
@@ -74,6 +74,40 @@ Extra arguments passed to the C-compiler.
 *--extra-link-args*=_args_::
 Extra arguments passed to the linker.
 
+=== Cross-compilation options
+
+*--cross-prefix*=_prefix_::
+Use __prefix__**gcc**, __prefix__**ld** and __prefix__**objdump** to build.
+_prefix_ may include a directory, for example
+_/opt/sdk/bin/aarch64-linux-gnu-_. *--install* with this option requires
+*--sysroot*.
+*--sysroot*=_directory_::
+Compile and link against the target system in _directory_. LinuxCNC headers
+and libraries are taken from the target installation paths below
+_directory_. With *--install*, components are installed below *DESTDIR* when it
+is set in the environment, otherwise below _directory_. A run-in-place
+*Makefile.modinc* contains host paths, so when *halcompile* runs from a
+run-in-place build, *--modinc* must name the *Makefile.modinc* of the
+installed target LinuxCNC.
+*--cc*=_command_::
+C compiler. Overrides the compiler selected by *--cross-prefix*.
+*--ld*=_command_::
+Linker used for the relocatable link of realtime components. Overrides the
+linker selected by *--cross-prefix*.
+*--objdump*=_command_::
+*objdump* used to list exported realtime symbols. Overrides the one selected by
+*--cross-prefix*.
+*--make*=_command_::
+*make* program to run.
+*--modinc*=_file_::
+*Makefile.modinc* to build with instead of the one belonging to this
+*halcompile*.
+
+_command_ is the path of an executable, or a command with arguments, such as
+*--cc*="ccache aarch64-linux-gnu-gcc". Without these options, *halcompile*
+uses the compiler LinuxCNC was configured with and the host *ld* and
+*objdump*. *LD* and *OBJDUMP* in the environment are ignored.
+
 == DESCRIPTION
 
 *halcompile* performs many different functions:
